  "implementation": "Full tracks at22050Hz mono IMA ADPCM256-byte/505-sample blocks. Fixed256-byte encoded,505-sample decoded and512-sample pending buffers. Bounded polling with SDK queue backpressure, short writes retained, exact fact sample count loops without block-padding silence. No global attenuation changes. Scene3 used only for player/watched battles; automatic computer battles retain strategy music. Timer3 wakes event pump without replacing events or advancing game ticks.",
