    "Native C200 scene fixture and four RAM-backed SDK file boundaries are excluded from delivery. Compressed file staging bypasses measured synthetic NAND ECC corruption. Native music player/decoder/audio/time/timer execute normally; production scene hooks also tested in compiled MIPS.",
    "No physical device or full campaign verification.",
    "Native Python frontend requires consuming newer QEMU audio packets; diagnostic receive adapter only drains and records PCM, does not replace game audio or timing."
